                        "sense_id": "e4d1ecaa-41dd-3551-b86b-0923e70a8d27",
                        "entry_id": "e740fbf9-490c-3083-923e-094a81de6f4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Supporting Sinarquism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "585d1e2f-5021-48b3-93ce-8581d3f5501f",
                                "sense_id": "e4d1ecaa-41dd-3551-b86b-0923e70a8d27",
                                "text": "In 1948, however, registration was denied to the Sinarquist political party, Fuerza Popular."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a7da94c-cfec-4a9e-abee-3792b17cecfb",
                                "sense_id": "e4d1ecaa-41dd-3551-b86b-0923e70a8d27",
                                "text": "As for those foreign people already living in Mexico are concerned, as long as they abide by Mexican standards which are laid down by the Sinarquist State, they shall be allowed to work and to live on the very same basis as Mexican citizens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01eb34fb-17cf-4b80-9a82-2570b0657ffd",
                                "sense_id": "e4d1ecaa-41dd-3551-b86b-0923e70a8d27",
                                "text": "Anti-Protestantism, in fact, played a role in Sinarquist propaganda somewhat comparable to that of anti-Semitism in fascist movements elsewhere."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
